              "explanation": [
                {
                  "text": "Photosynthesis supplies organic carbon but does not supply mineral nitrogen. Insect material can provide nitrogen for amino acids and other compounds. The nutritional inference has no dedicated current carnivorous-plant outcome and is attached to production of nitrogen-containing organic molecules in 13.1(12).",
